    "name": "Query",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "text",
    "contract": "Query is an abstract query descriptor. Construction associates one SQL text value, one logical name value, and one parameter-name sequence with the descriptor. Consumers can read those same associated values through Sql, Name, and ParameterNames. Each concrete Query type must supply its System.Data.CommandType through Type."
